 ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 13}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le02ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p><strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>We'll discuss risks associated to intellectual property, right?&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>Yes! I know that IT providers will limit liabilities related to claims by third parties.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>Providers don't include a warranty or indemnity that is connected with a third party. Besides, customers will have to consider the impact on their companies if they're asked to uninstall and stop using the software within a short period of time.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>What if the companies don't know about the infringement claims?&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>Well, there are some software companies which offer non-infringement warranties.</p>"}, {"time": "38500", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p><strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>Anyway, the breach of copyright can only be evidenced when there is copying involved and it's exclusively controlled by the company that designed the software.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>However, other software organizations provide an indemnity related to third party&rsquo;s infringement.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>What about the consequences of accepting an indemnity without the corresponding warranty?&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>Usually, the customers will be indemnified against the costs, damages, among other issues. However, customers will not have the right to terminate the license because the representation of the software was not infringed. So, if the customer wanted to cancel the license and change the product for a different one, it would be impossible.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>That's why the terms of indemnity need to be reviewed in detail.</p>"}, {"time": "91000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p><strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>Some providers will even limit the indemnity to the quantity of a simple award.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>The cost of defending a claim could be very significant, though.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter:&nbsp;</strong>Indeed! That's the reason why the terms should be reviewed carefully. A supplier will try to have the right to do any defense of a third party IP claim. Even when the customer is the responsible one of ensuring this defense at the supplier's cost.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Mary:&nbsp;</strong>And I guess the supplier cannot settle anything without the customer's permission.&nbsp;<br /> <strong>Peter</strong>: Sometimes, that permission isn't required, but there's a risk of prejudicing the customer's interests.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le02ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 4, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n7le02ob11re5vqz01pt1", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 5, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n7le02ob11re5vqz01pt2", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 6, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n7le02ob11re5vqz01pt3", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}